    "title": "Join PEEC Dec. 4 For Presentation On Snow Forecasting With Julien Ross - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Los Alamos Reporter ,\n2 hours ago Join Julien Ross, OpenSnow.com’s New Mexico Forecaster, on Wednesday, December 4, 6–7 PM at the Los Alamos Nature Center Planetarium (in-person and virtual). Hosted by the Pajarito Environmental Education Center (PEEC), this free event will share the 2025–2026 winter outlook, including the impacts of a weak La Niña or “La Nada” on snowfall. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
